{
  "name": "generating-financial-analysis-reports",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "description": "生成严格中英文字体、首行缩进、黑色三线表和自然财务分析语言的 Word 报告。",
  "entrypoints": {
    "skill": "SKILL.md",
